{"author":{"id":"b409816c5cd5ab140d1d52eb33aace35de44952bb794b19806fd57f6ecb1ace9"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1792833586,"nonce":"mQW1kZXmRQMMWKuzeMfMOW6JWn8=","title":"Compiler: the build script fails in a checkout without Cargo.lock","message":"Since 211a3015 the compiler's build fingerprint reads Cargo.lock (BUILD_INPUTS), but .gitignore excludes it, so a fresh clone or a git dependency has none and the build script stops with `Error: Os { code: 2, kind: NotFound }`. zyntax_compiler cannot be built as a git dependency (reported by the caribou session pinning zyntax by rev) or by CI from a clean checkout before cargo writes a lockfile there. Reproduced on the NUC: a throwaway crate depending on a copy of crates/compiler without the workspace Cargo.lock.","files":null}]}